              "page": 1,
              "page_is_reliable": true,
              "score": 0.8716,
              "relevance_score": 0.8716,
              "excerpt": "Incidents are classified as P1 (critical), P2 (high), P3 (medium), P4 (low). P1 incidents must be acknowledged within 15 minutes and resolved within 4 hours. P2 within 1 hour and 8 business hours respectively. If a P1 is not resolved within 2 hours, it is escalated to the Head of Infrastructure.",
